TypeScript compiler bug workload (etna-style)

This workload contains patches derived from TypeScript
(https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript), Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The patches were made against
release v6.0.3 and re-introduce historical bugs fixed upstream; they touch only
src/compiler/ and src/services/.

TypeScript's ThirdPartyNoticeText.txt covers third-party material in its
library declaration files (src/lib/, from DefinitelyTyped and others) and
Unicode data. No such material is included in this workload; setting the
workload up (bin/etna.py setup) clones TypeScript itself, which carries its
own LICENSE.txt and ThirdPartyNoticeText.txt.
